// 1-19: all the way across. all the way back.
id l1-19
name 1-19 LONG WIRE
tagline all the way across. all the way back.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main anchor capacitor secret
mechanics current:24 plank:5 anchor:6 yank:3 lift:1 capacitor:4 neon:2 white:2 secret:4
new -
portion 3 blocks 3 tall: double jump
portion 5 a low ceiling 9 long over a current notch
portion 6.3 neon/white stones nWnW (2 wide, 4 apart) over current
portion 4 a secret wall 10 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 7.3 capacitor gate 24 tiles away, current notch on the way
portion 5.3 drive a rail 10 long, swing a 15 gap (high anchors)
portion 5 a 3-tall plateau 10 wide with a current notch on top
portion 5.5 a 4-tall plateau 11 wide with a current notch on top
portion 5.4 zip 3 anchors (mid, ceiling, ceiling), 7-8 apart, over current
portion 5.1 hop 3 blocks 3 tall and 3 wide over 3-wide current
portion 5.2 hop 2 blocks 3 tall and 3 wide over 4-wide current
portion 5 capacitor lift up through gates to the top lane
portion 5 drive a rail 8 long, swing a 15 gap (ceiling anchors)
portion 3.5 steps up 4 tall and back down (16 wide)
portion 5.6 hop 5 one-way planks over current (heights 11123)
portion 5 capacitor gate 18 tiles away
portion 5.1 hop 3 blocks 2 tall and 2 wide over 4-wide current
portion 7.1 capacitor gate 24 tiles away, a block on the way
portion 4 a secret wall 8 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 5 a low ceiling 12 long over a current notch
portion 5.6 drive a rail 12 long, swing a 15 gap (ceiling anchors)
hardness 5.1
map
